 addAdmin('collections','Collections & wheel',`<div class="portal-layout"><form id="collectionForm" class="card owner-form"><h2>Create a new callsign group</h2><p>Each new group starts with a fresh pool of numbers. Existing purchases and recognition remain in history.</p><label for="groupName">Group callsign / name</label><input id="groupName" required maxlength="120"><label for="groupQuantity">Numbers (1–200)</label><input id="groupQuantity" type="number" min="1" max="200" value="50" required><label for="groupPrice">Price per number ($; enter 0 for FREE)</label><input id="groupPrice" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="10" required><label for="groupRelease">Release time (your local time)</label><input id="groupRelease" type="datetime-local" required><label for="newGroupDetails">Member details (optional)</label><textarea id="newGroupDetails" maxlength="3000" rows="4"></textarea><p class="small">Members can open these details from the Current Collection page.</p><label for="groupRecognition">Recognition time (your local time)</label><input id="groupRecognition" type="datetime-local"><label for="groupState">Visibility</label><select id="groupState"><option value="draft">Draft · owner only</option><option value="open">Open · visible to members</option><option value="closed">Closed · visible, no new purchases</option></select><label class="check"><input id="groupTest" type="checkbox"><span>Test mode · owner only · pretend checkout, no payment</span></label><button>Create new group</button></form><form id="wheelForm" class="card owner-form"><h2>Existing group & wheel</h2><label for="ownerGroup">Choose a group</label><select id="ownerGroup"></select><label for="editGroupTitle">Collection title</label><input id="editGroupTitle" maxlength="120" required><p class="small">Renaming the group keeps its purchases, numbers, and recognition history attached.</p><button id="saveGroupTitle" type="button" class="secondary">Save collection title</button><button id="pinCurrentCollection" type="button" class="secondary">Pin to top on Current collection</button><p id="featuredCollectionStatus" class="small" role="status"></p><label for="wheelSchedule">Recognition time (your local time)</label><input id="wheelSchedule" type="datetime-local"><label for="groupDetails">Member details (optional)</label><textarea id="groupDetails" maxlength="3000" rows="5"></textarea><p class="small">Shown to members from the Details link on Current Collection.</p><label class="check"><input id="wheelTest" type="checkbox"><span>Test mode · owner only · cannot change after numbers are assigned</span></label><label for="wheelState">Group status</label><select id="wheelState"><option value="draft">Draft</option><option value="open">Open</option><option value="closed">Closed</option><option value="recognized">Recognized</option></select><label for="rpm">Spin speed <output id="rpmValue"></output></label><input id="rpm" type="range" min="30" max="180" step="5"><label for="duration">Slowdown duration <output id="durationValue"></output></label><input id="duration" type="range" min="5" max="30"><label for="power">Slowdown profile</label><select id="power"><option value="2">Gradual glide</option><option value="3">Balanced</option><option value="5">Fast early, gentle finish</option></select><label for="idle">Idle roll <output id="idleValue"></output></label><input id="idle" type="range" min="0" max="6" step="0.5"><label class="check"><input id="automatic" type="checkbox"><span>Automatically recognize at the scheduled time</span></label><p class="small">Server checks scheduled recognition every five seconds. Signed-in viewers share one saved result.</p><button>Save group & wheel settings</button><button id="saveAndComposePush" type="button" class="secondary">Save & compose push</button><button id="ownerRefreshWheel" type="button" class="secondary">Refresh wheel</button><h3>Collection artwork</h3><label for="uploadArt">PNG, JPEG or WebP · up to 20 MB; large photos are resized automatically</label><input id="uploadArt" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"><button id="saveArt" type="button" class="secondary">Upload artwork</button><span id="artworkStatus" role="status"></span><img id="ownerArtPreview" class="portal-image" src="/assets/gac-logo-v3.png" alt="Saved collection artwork"><p id="ownerGroupSummary"></p><div class="card" style="margin-top:32px;border-color:#806b4c"><h3>Immediate recognition</h3><p class="small">Starts the recognition sequence right away. This is separate from saving group and wheel settings.</p><button id="ownerDraw" type="button" class="secondary">Recognize a number now</button></div></form></div><div class="card"><h2>Manage past callsign groups</h2><p>Remove old groups from the collection selector and wheel. Purchase and recognition history stays saved. Removed groups can be restored here.</p><div id="groupArchive"></div></div>`);
